  calls:
  - day: 1
    caller: "M\xFCd\xFCr (telefon)"
    lines:
    - "Alo? Hay\u0131rl\u0131 olsun, ilk g\xFCn\xFCn. K\u0131sa anlatay\u0131m, m\xFCteahhitler
      kap\u0131da."
    - "Gelen oturur, derdini anlat\u0131r. Lafa de\u011Fil k\xE2\u011F\u0131da bak:
      solda y\xF6netmelik, sa\u011Fda k\xFCnye ve ek rapor."
    - "K\xFCnyeye bir m\xFCh\xFCr basars\u0131n. Onay bin lira, red s\u0131f\u0131r.
      Perde ekle be\u015F y\xFCz, g\xFCnde bir kere."
    - "Kitapta yazmayan kusura tak\u0131lma. Ak\u015Fam kira kesilir. Kolay gelsin."
  - day: 5
    caller: "M\xFCd\xFCr (telefon)"
    lines:
    - "Alo, benim. Belediye kasas\u0131 bug\xFCn kapal\u0131, har\xE7 al\u0131nm\u0131yor."
    - "Yani bug\xFCn m\xFCh\xFCrler sana para getirmez. Ama binalar yine yap\u0131lacak,
      karar\u0131n yine ge\xE7erli."
    - Radyo da hep deprem diyor. Dikkatli bak.
  radio:
  - "Radyo: Uzmanlar b\xF6lgedeki fay hatt\u0131na dikkat \xE7ekiyor."
  - "Radyo: AFAD, deprem \xE7antas\u0131nda su, fener ve ilk yard\u0131m malzemesi
    bulunmas\u0131n\u0131 hat\u0131rlatt\u0131."
  - "Radyo: D\xFCn gece 3.8 b\xFCy\xFCkl\xFC\u011F\xFCnde bir sars\u0131nt\u0131
    hissedildi."
  - "Radyo: Uzmanlar, dolaplar\u0131n duvara sabitlenmesinin can kurtard\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131
    vurguluyor."
  - "Radyo: Son iki g\xFCnde onlarca k\xFC\xE7\xFCk sars\u0131nt\u0131 kaydedildi.
    Vatanda\u015Flar tedirgin."
  tremors:
  - 0
  - 0
  - 0.012
  - 0.02
  - 0.03
  messages:
  - day: 1
    sender: "E\u015Fin"
    family: 1
    text: "Kira bu ak\u015Fam kesiliyor, unutma. Bir de deprem \xE7antas\u0131 i\u015Fini
      konu\u015Fal\u0131m; Elif okulda tatbikat yapm\u0131\u015F, \xE7ok korkmu\u015F."
    condition: 0
    item: 0
    other: {fileID: 0}
    seal: 0
  - day: 2
    sender: "E\u015Fin"
    family: 1
    text: "\xC7anta geldi, kap\u0131n\u0131n yan\u0131na koydum. Bir de Elif'in odas\u0131ndaki
      dolap \xE7ok uzun, \xF6\u011Fretmen duvara vidalay\u0131n demi\u015F."
    condition: 1
    item: 0
    other: {fileID: 0}
    seal: 0
  - day: 2
    sender: "E\u015Fin"
    family: 1
    text: "\xC7anta i\u015Fini konu\u015Fmad\u0131k, Elif yine sordu. Bir de odas\u0131ndaki
      dolap \xE7ok uzun, \xF6\u011Fretmen duvara vidalay\u0131n demi\u015F."
    condition: 2
    item: 0
    other: {fileID: 0}
    seal: 0
  - day: 2
    sender: Bilinmeyen numara
    family: 0
    text: "Yak\u0131nda bir dosya gelecek. Yard\u0131mc\u0131 olursan\u0131z unutmam.
      -O"
    condition: 0
    item: 0
    other: {fileID: 0}
    seal: 0
  - day: 3
    sender: "E\u015Fin"
    family: 1
    text: "Usta geldi, dolaplar\u0131 duvara sabitledi. Elif rahat uyudu."
    condition: 1
    item: 1
    other: {fileID: 0}
    seal: 0
  - day: 3
    sender: "E\u015Fin"
    family: 1
    text: "Gece Elif'in odas\u0131ndaki dolap salland\u0131, \xE7ok korktuk."
    condition: 2
    item: 1
    other: {fileID: 0}
    seal: 0
  - day: 3
    sender: Ev sahibi
    family: 0
    text: "Bina eski, kom\u015Fular g\xFC\xE7lendirme i\xE7in para topluyor. Sizin
      pay\u0131n\u0131z 4.000 TL. Telefondaki d\xFCkk\xE2ndan \xF6denebiliyor, yar\u0131n
      ak\u015Fam son g\xFCn."
    condition: 0
    item: 0
    other: {fileID: 0}
    seal: 0
  - day: 4
    sender: "E\u015Fin"
    family: 1
    text: "G\xFC\xE7lendirme paras\u0131 yetiyor mu? Ev sahibi bu ak\u015Fam son
      g\xFCn dedi."
    condition: 0
    item: 0
    other: {fileID: 0}
    seal: 0
  - day: 4
    sender: Bilinmeyen numara
    family: 0
    text: "Te\u015Fekk\xFCrler. Kimse bir \u015Fey demez. -O"
    condition: 3
    item: 0
    other: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9ac03a467c981484cb0d0e4e6f4b1b83, type: 2}
    seal: 1
  - day: 4
    sender: Bilinmeyen numara
    family: 0
    text: "Pi\u015Fman olacaks\u0131n. -O"
    condition: 3
    item: 0
    other: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9ac03a467c981484cb0d0e4e6f4b1b83, type: 2}
    seal: 2
